cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "この寄託物を使った場合は、下の形で引用してください。"
title: "Scripts and measurements for an audit of receptor preparation in molecular docking"
abstract: >-
  Scripts and complete measurement tables for an audit of the receptor
  preparation steps that precede molecular docking, on a resolution-stratified
  sample of 100 single-chain protein crystal structures from the RCSB Protein
  Data Bank. Covers the order in which heteroatoms are removed, the choice
  between PDB2PQR and Meeko, Meeko's bad-residue flag, and the default altloc
  setting, together with the resulting titration states, tool disagreements
  and surface electrostatic potentials.
type: dataset
license: MIT
license-url: "https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-09"

authors:
  - family-names: "Mizuguchi"
    given-names: "Tomoko"
    affiliation: "Faculty of Materials Science and Engineering, Kyoto Institute of Technology"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9780-765X"
    email: "mizuguti@kit.ac.jp"

keywords:
  - molecular docking
  - receptor preparation
  - protonation state
  - electrostatic potential
  - PDB2PQR
  - Meeko
  - reproducibility

